A_611 - For those who have to make a journey in the morning to go to work and on the way they know that there are approachable trees, since it is not a crime to fertilize trees, if they have a backpack and a few bottles of natural fertilizer with them, they can take advantage of it if they want. Trees like it if they are fertilized every now and then, and using that journey to leave some fertilizer is definitely a good idea.